"Galactus\nApparently a leaker is teasing Galactus as the main villain in the FF movie\\. That’s kind of a shame if it’s true, though I suspect it’s far from, at the very least, the whole truth\\. \n\nI commented:\n> While I can see Galactus being referenced as a looming threat, I can’t imagine he’ll be the main focus of the movie\\.\n> \n> Maybe I’m just too stuck in my own personal vision of what a Fantastic Four movie should be, but I think their introductory movie is better served by a smaller, one\\-off villain serving as an obstacle rather than the entire plot\\.\n> \n> The movie should be about the characters and the adventure, not the threat, and I think that’s harder to do with a villain like Galactus\\.\n> \n> Do Red Ghost as a rival scientist explorer\\. Introduce the Watcher and set him up to help Earth when Galactus *does* show up\\.\n\nSomeone else had a decent thought though:\n> So the F4 will be saving another planet in Space from him, right? Which will maybe set him up to come to earth later\\. Cause dealing with Galactus on earth without it being a high stakes crossover feels weird"
